// # Six println string statements
//
// Logline: Print six string literals so emit-wasm can plant all six texts.
//
// Setup: One public main. Body is only six println(STRING) statements.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Print line-a through line-c.
//   2. Print line-d through line-f.
//   3. Leave no other statements.

pub fn main() {
    println("line-a");
    println("line-b");
    println("line-c");
    println("line-d");
    println("line-e");
    println("line-f");
}
